WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.180
And after you graduated from twelfth grade, what did you do?

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:10.520
I went to . . . When I graduated there was a big depression,

3
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:18.200
and I knew my dad had taken all these others through college, and I knew that it was going to be a hardship.

4
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.640
He and Mama were getting older then.

5
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:31.700
So I saw in the paper this business school for just a hundred dollars.

6
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:38.380
So I asked my daddy if I could go there, and he said, “Sure, but I’m going to have to take you the first day,

7
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:45.040
to see if they’ll take ten dollars a month, because there’s really not much cash.”

8
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.820
It was a big depression at that time.
